552 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 275 0 R
/T (Sunhuine began in 1992 as a small stall in Gwangjang Market, opened by Chu Jeong-ae and later run with her family. The name comes from a relative's daughter, Sunhui. Their method has not changed: soaked mung beans are ground on a millstone, and the batter is fried in plenty of pork fat until the edges shatter and the middle stays soft. The family turned down offers to franchise so they could keep making the pancakes themselves. The prices are still market prices, which is why you see office workers and grandmothers sharing the same counters.)
/E (Sunhuine began in 1992 as a small stall in Gwangjang Market, opened by Chu Jeong-ae and later run with her family. The name comes from a relative's daughter, Sunhui. Their method has not changed: soaked mung beans are ground on a millstone, and the batter is fried in plenty of pork fat until the edges shatter and the middle stays soft. The family turned down offers to franchise so they could keep making the pancakes themselves. The prices are still market prices, which is why you see office workers and grandmothers sharing the same counters.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
