647 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 279 0 R
/T (Namyeong-dong sits between Seoul Station and Yongsan, a working neighborhood of small offices, student flats near Sookmyung Women's University and long-running grill houses. Chowon is a beef barbecue restaurant whose regulars come for one cut: ox tongue, sliced thick and seared over the grill until it is crisp outside and tender inside. Staff show first-timers how to cook it, and the meal moves on to marinated Hanwoo beef and the house's salted short ribs. It is small and popular, so most tables are booked ahead.)
/E (Namyeong-dong sits between Seoul Station and Yongsan, a working neighborhood of small offices, student flats near Sookmyung Women's University and long-running grill houses. Chowon is a beef barbecue restaurant whose regulars come for one cut: ox tongue, sliced thick and seared over the grill until it is crisp outside and tender inside. Staff show first-timers how to cook it, and the meal moves on to marinated Hanwoo beef and the house's salted short ribs. It is small and popular, so most tables are booked ahead.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [5]
>>
