673 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 280 0 R
/T (Noksapyeong, at the bottom of the hill that leads up to Haebangchon and Gyeongnidan, has long been where Seoul's international residents meet for a casual night out. Nekkid Wings fits right in: a sports-bar room with games on the screens, cold beer and a long list of sauces and dry rubs. Locals and expats mix at the tables, ordering platters to share. Classic Buffalo is the favorite, and the giant onion ring croquettes are a reason to come on their own.)
/E (Noksapyeong, at the bottom of the hill that leads up to Haebangchon and Gyeongnidan, has long been where Seoul's international residents meet for a casual night out. Nekkid Wings fits right in: a sports-bar room with games on the screens, cold beer and a long list of sauces and dry rubs. Locals and expats mix at the tables, ordering platters to share. Classic Buffalo is the favorite, and the giant onion ring croquettes are a reason to come on their own.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [5]
>>
