699 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 281 0 R
/T (Hannam-dong's back streets are full of small restaurants that open quietly and stay busy by word of mouth. Atta is one of them: a narrow room built around a wood-fired oven, where pizzas come out blistered and smoky. The crust is thin and chewy, and the jambon pizza, with ham, sweet and salty, is the one most tables order. A short list of salads keeps things fresh. It is popular with couples and friends meeting after a walk around Hannam, so plan ahead for dinner.)
/E (Hannam-dong's back streets are full of small restaurants that open quietly and stay busy by word of mouth. Atta is one of them: a narrow room built around a wood-fired oven, where pizzas come out blistered and smoky. The crust is thin and chewy, and the jambon pizza, with ham, sweet and salty, is the one most tables order. A short list of salads keeps things fresh. It is popular with couples and friends meeting after a walk around Hannam, so plan ahead for dinner.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
>>
