795 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 285 0 R
/T (Every Seoul neighborhood has its Chinese restaurant for family dinners and weekday lunches, and near Seorae Village that place is Miyo. It serves the Korean-Chinese favorites, black bean noodles, spicy seafood noodle soup and sweet-and-sour pork, alongside a Peking duck that regulars say is one of the best values in the area. The pork is thick and tender, the sauce comes on the side, and the oyster noodle soup appears in the colder months. It is relaxed, unfussy and full of local families.)
/E (Every Seoul neighborhood has its Chinese restaurant for family dinners and weekday lunches, and near Seorae Village that place is Miyo. It serves the Korean-Chinese favorites, black bean noodles, spicy seafood noodle soup and sweet-and-sour pork, alongside a Peking duck that regulars say is one of the best values in the area. The pork is thick and tender, the sauce comes on the side, and the oyster noodle soup appears in the colder months. It is relaxed, unfussy and full of local families.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
