950 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 291 0 R
/T (Samwon Garden opened in the mid-1970s, as apartment towers were rising across this part of Gangnam. Its founder wanted city families to have a green place to eat, like a picnic, so he built the restaurant around a landscaped garden. The idea caught on so well that 'garden' became a common name for Korean barbecue restaurants across the country. Today staff grill prime Hanwoo beef at your table, and the dining room still looks out onto the trees and stone paths.)
/E (Samwon Garden opened in the mid-1970s, as apartment towers were rising across this part of Gangnam. Its founder wanted city families to have a green place to eat, like a picnic, so he built the restaurant around a landscaped garden. The idea caught on so well that 'garden' became a common name for Korean barbecue restaurants across the country. Today staff grill prime Hanwoo beef at your table, and the dining room still looks out onto the trees and stone paths.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [5]
>>
