1105 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 297 0 R
/T (Queen's Blvd is a small Mexican kitchen on a Dogok-dong side street, a few doors from Onestar. It makes California-style burritos, the San Diego specialty where French fries go inside instead of rice, along with carne asada and cheese. The result is filling but bright, and the loaded fries, piled with barbecue pork, have their own fans. Neighbors stop in for a quick lunch or carry burritos home.)
/E (Queen's Blvd is a small Mexican kitchen on a Dogok-dong side street, a few doors from Onestar. It makes California-style burritos, the San Diego specialty where French fries go inside instead of rice, along with carne asada and cheese. The result is filling but bright, and the loaded fries, piled with barbecue pork, have their own fans. Neighbors stop in for a quick lunch or carry burritos home.)
