1904 0 obj
<<
/Title (Seoul has never been easier to eat your way through. Ranking lists, short videos and map ratings send visitors to the same handful of places, and the lines outside them grow longer every year. But many of the city's best meals happen somewhere else: in a family restaurant that has served one dish since the 1940s, at a dumpling counter by the gate of a market, or in a noodle shop in the basement of an apartment complex.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1692 0 R
/Next 2125 0 R
>>
