2128 0 obj
<<
/Title (Every restaurant in this book was chosen from personal experience, not from rankings or reviews: these are places I have eaten at myself and would happily send a friend to. Each entry has four parts: the restaurant's story, what to order, when to go and how to get there. Dish names are given in Korean too, so you can point to them or show them to the staff.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1906 0 R
/First 2275 0 R
/Last 2275 0 R
/Count -1
/Next 2276 0 R
>>
