2133 0 obj
<<
/Title (On a side street in Dogok-dong, a residential neighborhood south of Gangnam's office blocks, Onestar makes American diner burgers the old way: hand-formed patties, toasted buns and melted cheese. The menu is short and focused, and the patty melt, grilled like a sandwich so the patty stays juicy, has become the regulars' favorite. Neighbors line up on the pavement at lunchtime, and many come back for the mushroom Swiss.)
/Dest [40 0 R /Fit]
