/Title (In the same basement arcade as Sanwol, Twigim Ajeossi \('the fritter man'\) fries squid, shrimp, sweet potato, dumplings and glass-noodle seaweed rolls to order. The batter is light and stays crisp, and the prices are made for students: most baskets are a few thousand won. Students stop by between classes and parents pick up bags to take home. Mix and match two or three kinds in one order, and eat them while they are hot.)
