2437 0 obj
<<
/Title (Walk into Namdaemun Market from Hoehyeon Station and this is one of the first shops you meet: a crowd on the pavement, steam rising from bamboo baskets and staff folding dumplings by hand behind the counter. Namdaemun is one of Seoul's oldest markets, and Gamekol feeds its shopkeepers, delivery drivers and visitors all day long. The dumplings are the size of a fist, with thin skins and generous fillings of pork or kimchi. The line moves fast, so the baskets are refilled constantly and the dumplings you get are almost always hot.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2398 0 R
/Prev 2436 0 R
/First 2476 0 R
/Last 2477 0 R
/Count -6
>>
endobj
