2528 0 obj
<<
/Title (Yeongdong Jokbal has served braised pig's trotters near Yangjae Station since 1983, and it is often named one of Seoul's three great jokbal houses. Demand grew so much that it opened four more branches nearby. The trotters are braised in a soy-based broth until tender and served warm and thinly sliced, with no herbal or gamey smell. Groups fill the tables after work, and many neighbors simply pick up a box to take home. Spicy buckwheat noodles on a tray are the classic partner.)
/Dest [32 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2481 0 R
/Prev 2527 0 R
/First 2574 0 R
