2695 0 obj
<<
/Title (Noksapyeong, at the bottom of the hill that leads up to Haebangchon and Gyeongnidan, has long been where Seoul's international residents meet for a casual night out. Nekkid Wings fits right in: a sports-bar room with games on the screens, cold beer and a long list of sauces and dry rubs. Locals and expats mix at the tables, ordering platters to share. Classic Buffalo is the favorite, and the giant onion ring croquettes are a reason to come on their own.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2658 0 R
/Prev 2694 0 R
/First 2727 0 R
/Last 2728 0 R
/Count -6
>>
