2699 0 obj
<<
/Title (Gopchang, grilled beef intestines, is one of Korea's favorite foods to share over drinks, and Meokgeori in Jamwon-dong is where many Seoul diners go to try it at its best. The intestines are cleaned with care so they taste clean and nutty, then grilled at the table until crisp and chewy. Beef tripe \(yang\) is just as popular. The room is small and always busy, and the meal ends the classic way: rice fried on the grill in the leftover fat.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2659 0 R
/Prev 2698 0 R
/First 2734 0 R
/Last 2735 0 R
/Count -6
>>
