2763 0 obj
<<
/Title (Bubble and Cockles is a pojangmacha-style pub, the kind of place Koreans go to share many plates and talk late into the night. The menu follows the seasons and the market, with raw fish, seafood and hearty stews. Its best-known plate is mungtigi, a specialty from Daegu: thick slices of very fresh raw beef, eaten with a sesame-oil dip. Aged flounder sashimi and a spicy cod stew round out the table. The room is loud and packed, which is the point.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2731 0 R
/Prev 2762 0 R
/First 2793 0 R
/Last 2794 0 R
/Count -6
>>
